-- One-time data update: Baqueira-Beret Run gets a new layout.
--
-- Its own layout and opening (Moses, 15 Nov 2026: the World Tour re-layouts):
-- until now it was physically the same track as Paris Eiffel Tower Run and
-- Bobsleigh Run. Down the ridge and a wide turn across the open bowl under the
-- chairlift (the rolling start, the field let go in waves), over the moguls,
-- the spiral round the Romanesque bell tower, the hairpin, down the
-- Escornacrabes couloir under a circling vulture (the big feature and new
-- signature: the resort's steepest run), a sweep down the valley, S-bends
-- through the forest and into the village. Its name, slug, look and past races
-- stay. Its track record, country records and players' personal bests start
-- again from now (tracks.records_since); past results stay. Races already run
-- keep their stored replays and play back exactly as they ran.
--
-- Generated from src/game/physicsTracks.js by scripts/physics-track-sql.js --relayout.
-- Only the Baqueira-Beret Run track row changes.

